meta {
  name: Mark as paid
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/mark-as-paid
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Admin only. UNSCHEDULED / SCHEDULED / INITIATED -> PAID. Sets
  paidAt. Bill -> PAID (from APPROVED for the UNSCHEDULED origin,
  from SCHEDULED for the rail-driven path). UNSCHEDULED covers the
  OFF_PLATFORM use case — the operator records that the bill was
  paid externally without coordinating a rail.
}
